OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I had depression for 14
OL,4,Ayears until I got sectioned - it was
OL,5,Abipolar
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Kimberley Atkinson was told she
OL,8,Fhad depression, the diagnosis made
OL,9,Fsense to her.
OL,11,FShe had struggled with her mental
OL,12,Fhealth since she was a teenager and
OL,13,Fhoped being prescribed antidepressants
OL,14,Fwould improve things.
OL,16,F"My mood had always been up and down,
OL,17,Fand my emotional regulation was never
OL,18,Fvery good," Kimberley said.
