OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I had depression for 14
OL,4,Ayears until I got sectioned - it was
OL,5,Abipolar
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe said the impact it had on her life
OL,8,Fwas awful, with depressions that felt
OL,9,Flike "sinking into a dark hole",
OL,10,Fleaving her stuck in bed and not able
OL,11,Fto face the day.
